  ammitto:remarks "\nInvolved in the unresolved disappearances of Yuri Zakharenko, Viktor Gonchar, Anatoly Krasovski and Dmitri Zavadski in Belarus in 1999-2000. Iury Leanidavich Sivakau was Minister of the Interior at that time and therefore a senior Official in the Government of Belarus. Sivakau was associated with other Belarus Officials who have been listed for their involvement in these disappearances, and helped to establish a “death squad” in 1996 with Vladimir Navumau." ;
  ammitto:rawSourceData [ a ammitto:RawSourceData ; ammitto:sourceFormat "xml" ; ammitto:sourceSpecificFields """{"uk:ofsiGroupId":"11723","uk:unReferenceNumber":null,"uk:designationSource":"UK","uk:sanctionsImposed":"Asset freeze|Travel Ban|Director Disqualification Sanction","uk:entityType":"Individual"}""" ] .
