  ammitto:remarks "\nAs Deputy Chief Executive Officer of the President of Belarus and Deputy Head of the Belarus President Property Management Directorate, Genadz Bogdan is actively supporting the Lukashenka regime and bears a responsibility for the repression of civil society or democratic opposition in Belarus and actions and policies or activities which undermine democracy or the rule of law in Belarus." ;
