  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "CHW0007" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nVladimir Stepanovich Alexseyev is the First Deputy Head of the GRU (a.k.a. GU). Given his senior leadership role in the GRU, Alexseyev is responsible for the possession, transport and use in Salisbury during the weekend of 4 March 2018 of the toxic nerve agent “Novichok” by officers from the GRU." ;
