  ammitto:remarks "\nAdmiral of the Korean People's Army. Former member of the Central Military Commission of the Workers’ Party of Korea, which is a key body for national defence matters in DPRK. Commander in Chief of the Korean Navy, which is involved in the development of ballistic missile-related programmes and in the development of the nuclear capacities of the DPRK naval forces. As such, responsible for is, or has been, involved in the facilitation of any of the DPRK’s military programmes." ;
