  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "GAC0021" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nALEJOS LORENZANA is a Deputy and Vice President of the Board of Directors of the Congress of Guatemala. He has been involved in serious corruption using his position to attract clients with the offer of expediting the refund of tax credits in exchange for bribes, and benefitting from commission charges He is responsible for, and facilitated or provided support for, and benefitted from, serious corruption." ;
