  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "GHR0015" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nElena Anatolievna Trikulya, as an investigator for the Investigative Committee in the Russian Ministry of the Interior after the death of Sergei Magnitsky on 16 November 2009, failed to properly investigate those responsible for his mistreatment in detention, which contributed significantly to his death, and concealed evidence in relation to that conduct." ;
