  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "GHR0026" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nFahad Shabib A. Albalawi was a Royal Guard in Saudi Arabia. He was directly involved in carrying out the unlawful killing of Jamal Khashoggi at the Saudi Consulate in Istanbul on 2 October 2018, as part of the 15 man team sent to Turkey by Saudi authorities." ;
