  ammitto:remarks "\nJoseph Pierre Richard DUPLAN is an involved person within the meaning of the Global Human Rights Sanctions Regulations 2020 because he is or has been involved in the commission of a serious human rights violation or abuse in Haiti. In particular, Joseph Pierre Richard DUPLAN was President Moïse’s Departmental Delegate and, whilst in this senior role, participated in the planning of the La Saline massacre that took place in 2018. \n" ;
