  ammitto:remarks "\nAlen BASIL is an involved person under the Global Irregular Migration and Trafficking in Persons Sanctions Regulations 2025 as he is or has engaged in a relevant activity, namely people smuggling. Alen BASIL is responsible for, is involved in the facilitation of, and profits financially from, people smuggling, in the form of unlawful arrival into a country of a person who is not a national of that country or permanently resident in it. Namely, Alen BASIL became the boss of a large smuggling network in Northwest Serbia.  \n" ;
  ammitto:rawSourceData [ a ammitto:RawSourceData ; ammitto:sourceFormat "xml" ; ammitto:sourceSpecificFields """{"uk:ofsiGroupId":"17037","uk:unReferenceNumber":null,"uk:designationSource":"UK","uk:sanctionsImposed":"Asset freeze|Travel Ban|Director Disqualification Sanction","uk:entityType":"Individual"}""" ] .
