  ammitto:remarks "\nMariwan JAMAL (“JAMAL”) is an involved person under the Global Irregular Migration and Trafficking in Persons Sanctions Regulations 2025 (“the Regulations”) as he is or has been involved in a relevant activity, namely people smuggling, by transferring by any means funds or economic resources which constitute payment for the unlawful arrival in a country of a person who is not a national of that country or permanently resident in it. Specifically, he controls money movements through a Hawala banker. These are payments for the smuggling of persons from the Kurdistan region of Iraq to Europe via Turkey.\n" ;
