  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "IRN0030" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nHead of the Tehran Judiciary. Former Head of Iran's Prisons Organisation. In this capacity, he was complicit to the massive detention of political protesters and covering up abuses performed in the jailing system." ;
