  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/uk/consolidated-list/irn0059> ;
  ammitto:remarks "Vice-Minister in charge of the Press up to December 2013|Former Vice Minister of Culture and Islamic Guidance in charge of the press (Nov 2009 – Dec 2010) The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025." .
