  ammitto:remarks "Vice-chairman of the judiciary administration of South Khorasan province, in charge of crime prevention. In addition to his acknowledging, in June 2011, 140 executions for capital offences between March 2010 and March 2011, about 100 other executions are The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025." .
