  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "IRN0062" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nDeputy head of the Ministry of Justice in the Khorasan Razavi province. Former prosecutor of Kermanshah. Has played a role in the high number of death sentences being passed in Iran, including prosecuting the cases of seven prisoners convicted of drug trafficking who were hanged on the same day on 3 January 2010 in Kermanshah's central prison." ;
