  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "IRN0079" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nChief of the Cyber Police. In this capacity, he announced a campaign for the recruitment of government hackers in order to achieve better control of information on the internet and attack ‘dangerous’ sites." ;
