  ammitto:hasSanctionEntry <https://www.ammitto.org/entry/uk/consolidated-list/lib0079> ;
  ammitto:remarks "AVAX (IMO 9058713) was listed on 22 July 2026, pursuant to paragraphs 10(a), 10(b), 10(c) and 10(d) of resolution 2146 (2014), as amended by paragraph 2 of resolutions 2441 (2018) and 2509 (2020) and extended in resolution 2819 (2026), as attempting to illicitly export petroleum.\n\nShipping sanctions: a specified ship is prohibited from being provided with access to or having its master or pilot cause it to enter a port in the UK, may have its registration on the UK Ship Register terminated, and a master or pilot of a specified ship may be given a port barring direction, a detention direction, and a port entry direction or a movement direction." .
