  ammitto:remarks "\nChair of the Crimea Electoral Commission. Responsible for administering the Crimean 'referendum'. Responsible under the Russian system for signing referendum results. In the capacity of Chair of the Crimea Electoral Commission he participated in the organisation of the Russian presidential elections of 18 March 2018 in the illegally annexed Crimea and Sevastopol, and thereby actively supported and implemented politics that undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
