  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0030" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer so-called “Minister of the Council of Ministers” (Head of the administration for governmental affairs) of the “Donetsk People’s Republic”. In taking on and acting in this capacity, he has therefore actively supported actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, and further destabilised Ukraine. Remains active in supporting separatist actions or policies. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
