  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer Deputy in the State Duma. Originator and co-sponsor of legislative proposals in Russia that would have allowed regions of other countries to join Russia without their central authorities' prior agreement. As of September 2015, a Member of the Federation Council from Omsk Region. Currently Deputy Chairman of the Federation Council Committee on Constitutional Legislation and State Building. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
