  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0036" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer Speaker of the State Duma. Publicly supported the deployment of Russian forces in Ukraine. Publicly supported the Russia-Crimea unification treaty and the related federal constitutional law. Currently Director of the Foreign Intelligence Service of the Russian Federation as of October 2016. Permanent member of the Security Council of the Russian Federation. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
