  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer so called \"Prime Minister of the Council of Ministers of the People's Republic of Luhansk, confirmed on 8 July 2014. Responsible for the separatist \"governmental\" activities of the so called \"government of the People's Republic of Luhansk.\" Continues activites of supporting LNR separatist structures.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
