  ammitto:remarks "\nMember of the State Duma and Governor of Khabarovsk Territory. On 23.5.2014 he announced the inauguration of the ‘de facto embassy’ of the unrecognized, so called, ‘Donetsk People's Republic’ in Moscow, he contributes to undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
