  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0093" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer so-called ‘Minister of Justice’ of the so called ‘Donetsk People's Republic’.  In taking on and acting in this capacity, she has therefore actively supported actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine and to further destabilise Ukraine. \nCommissioner for Human Rights of the so-called of the ‘Donetsk People's Republic.' \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
