  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer Commander of the Russian Airborne Troops, Colonel-General. In his senior position holds responsibility for the deployment of Russian airborne forces in Crimea. Currently Chairperson of the Defence Committee of the State Duma of the Russian Federation. Remains active in implementing Russia’s annexation of Crimea and Sevastopol. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
