  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0147" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nFormer Member of the Rada, as such publicly called for the creation of the so-called Federal Republic of Novorossiya, composed of South Eastern Ukrainian regions.  Former \"Speaker\" of the so-called \"Parliament of the Union of the People's Republics\" (\"Parliament of Novorossiya\").\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
