  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0179" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nJSC Zaliv Shipyard actively participated in the construction of new railway approaches to the Kerch Bridge, connecting Russian to the illegally annexed Crimean peninsula. Therefore, it is supporting the consolidation of the illegally annexed Crimean peninsula into the Russian Federation, which in turn further undermines the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
