  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0195" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nRadical paramilitary organisation, responsible for openly supporting using force to end Ukraine’s control over Crimea, thus undermining the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. Responsible for training separatists to fight against the Ukrainian government forces in Eastern Ukraine, thus threatening the stability or security of Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
