  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0218" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nNemtsev became Chair of the “Legislative Assembly” of Sevastopol in September 2019. Nemtsev is also leader of United Russia’s Sevastopol branch and involved in the Russian-organised illegal local elections, which undermined Ukrainian sovereignty. He has also been awarded a medal for the “return of Crimea” from the Russian Defence Ministry, demonstrating his involvement in activities undermining Ukrainian territorial integrity. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
