  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0238" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nRostec is a major Russian state owned defence conglomerate. It is a major supplier of the Russian military and related enterprises. Rostec and its subsidiaries, provide financial services or makes available funds and economic resources, goods and/or technology that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
