  ammitto:remarks "\nVTB Bank PJSC is owned by and/or associated with the Russian government and has received significant financial support from the Russian government. The Russian government is involved in activities to destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
