  ammitto:remarks "\nAs Head of the Pinsk border detachment at the State Border Committee of the Republic of Belarus, Dmitry VINNIKOV is or has been involved in engaging or providing support for an action which destabilises Ukraine or undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, namely, facilitating the movement of Russian troops across the Belarus border into Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
