  ammitto:remarks "\nAleksandr Grigoryevich VOLFOVICH is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he has been involved in in destabilizing Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, on the basis of having been, and being, involved in engaging in or providing support for policies or actions, which destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threated the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
