  ammitto:remarks "\nMajor General Oleg Leonidovich VOINOV has been involved in engaging or providing support for policies and actions that have destabilised Ukraine or undermined or threatened the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, namely, as the Head of the International Military Cooperation Department of the Ministry of Defence of Belarus being involved either in direct command of or in a position to hold considerable situational awareness of Belarusian forces involved in the Russian invasion of Ukraine through the facilitation of Russian freedom of movement into the north of Ukraine. \n \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
