  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0753" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nDmitry PESKOV is President Putin’s Press Secretary and vocal supporter of the Government of Russia in Russian and international media. In statements and interviews Dmitry Peskov has promoted policies or actions which destabilize Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
