  ammitto:remarks "\n Lieutenant General Andrey Ivanovich SYCHEVOY is a member of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation, he currently holds the position of Commander 8th Combined Arms Army, Southern Military District. He is considered to have been in direct command of and/or to have substantial influence regarding the deployment of troops involved in the Russian invasion of Ukraine. There are therefore reasonable grounds to suspect that he is a person who is responsible for, engages in, provides support for, or promotes any policy or action which destabilises Ukraine or undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
