  ammitto:remarks "\nDmitry Valeryevich UTKIN is a member/associate of the Wagner Group, a Russian Private Military Company, which has conducted military operations in Ukraine. UTKIN, therefore, is or has been responsible for, or has engaged in actions or policies that destabilise Ukraine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
