  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS0846" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that German Valentinovich BELOUS is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground:\n \nGerman Valentinovich BELOUS has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director (whether executive or non-executive), trustee, or other manager or equivalent of an entity carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian financial services sector.\nThe trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023. \n" ;
