  ammitto:remarks "\nThere are reasonable grounds to suspect that Kira KOVALCHUK is closely associated with KIRILL KOVALCHUCK (RUS0853) as his wife. KIRILL KOVALCHUK is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulation 2019.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
