  ammitto:remarks "\nAndrey Valerievich RYUMIN is Director General and Chair of the Management Board at Rosseti PJSC. Rosseti PJSC is carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia – the Russian energy sector. RYUMIN, as a Director or equivalent of Rosseti PJSC, is therefore involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
