  ammitto:remarks "\nTigran Oganesovich Khudaverdyan was the Executive Director & Deputy CEO at Yandex, a leading Russian technology company, until March 2022. Khudaverdyan therefore has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia, as director of an entity carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia – namely, the Russian information, communications and digital technologies sector. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
