  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS1050" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nDina Rinatovna MALIKOVA is President and Chair of the board of the Russian Regional Development Bank. In this role she is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from, or supporting, the Government of Russia by working as a director or equivalent in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia (the Russian financial services sector). \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
