  ammitto:remarks "\nAliaksandr Piatrovich VETSIANEVICH, is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) 2019. As the Deputy Director General of Minsk Wheeled Tractor Plant (MZKT), he has made available goods or technology that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
