  ammitto:remarks "\nKESAEV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because as a shareholder of V.A Degtyarev Weapons plant, which has been carrying on business in the Russian defence sector - a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, he is a member of an involved person. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
