  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS1318" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nEvgeny Borisovich ZUBITSKIY is the co-owner and CEO of Industrial Metallurgical Holding (IMH) and owner of JSC Koks via IMH. ZUBITSKIY therefore is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by indirectly owning an entity which is carrying on business in sectors of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, the Russian energy and extractives sectors. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
