  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS1324" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nLyudmila RUKAVISHIKOVA is the mother-in-law of prominent Russian oligarch Sergey CHEMEZOV, with whom she is closely associated and from whom she has obtained a financial benefit or other material benefit. Sergey CHEMEZOV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
