  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS1353" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\n Promtech-Dubna JSC is a leading Russian manufacturer of marine, aircraft and spacecraft equipment. They have obtained a benefit from the Government of Russia in the transport sector through their salient role in the Russian transport industry, and their close association to the Government of Russia, and are therefore an involved person. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
