  ammitto:remarks "\n LLC Military Industrial Company is a manufacturer of armoured vehicles which have been used by Russian military forces in territorial Ukraine. LLC Military Industrial Company has therefore made available goods or technology that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, and in doing so has also contributed to the Russian defence sector, a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
