  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS1361" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nIlya KIVA is a former member of the Ukrainian parliament (Verkhovna Rada) who has provided support for and promoted Russia’s invasion of Ukraine. KIVA is therefore an involved person who provides support for or promotes policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
