  ammitto:remarks "\nIvan TYRYSHKIN is an involved person as he is obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director at SPB Exchange and JSC NRK-R.O.S.T. Both companies are carrying on business in the Russian financial services sector, which is a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia.   \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
