  ammitto:remarks "\nUnited World International is an online news site which promotes pro-Russian disinformation. There are reasonable grounds to believe that this entity is or has been involved supporting, or promoting policies or actions which destabilises Ukraine or undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023." ;
