  ammitto:remarks "\nSergei Vadimovich TREGUB is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: 1) TREGUB is associated with a person who is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from the Government of Russia, namely Alexei Borisovich MILLER; 2) TREGUB is involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia through owning or controlling an entity that is carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian construction sector.\n" ;
