  ammitto:remarks "\nJSC Krastsvetmet is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit)  Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: (1) Krastsvetmet is involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine as it makes available economic resources that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine; and (2) Krastsvetmet is involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia through carrying on business as a Government of Russia-affiliated entity. \n" ;
