  ammitto:remarks "\nOcean Speedstar Solutions OPC PVT LTD is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 based on the following ground: Ocean Speedstar Solutions Ltd is involved in supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector. \n" ;
