  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS2313" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nAvangard, an educational and methodological organisation providing so-called patriotic education, including basic military training to the youths of Russia, as well as to children in the temporarily occupied territories of Ukraine, is an “involved person” under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because it is or has been\n involved in (1) destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine by engaging in and providing support for the Government of Russia’s programme for the forced deportation and re-education of Ukrainian children, and (2)\n obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia in its role as a Government of Russia-affiliated entity. \n" ;
