  ammitto:remarks "\nDenis Gennadevich POPOV, hereafter POPOV, is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: \n \nPOPOV is and has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia or destabilising or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine by working for the Government of Russia as Deputy Minister of the Russian Federation for the Ministry of Civil Defence, Emergencies and Disaster Relief. \n" ;
