  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS2725" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nIvan Aleksandrovich NIKIFOROV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 based on the following ground: (i) Ivan Aleksandrovich NIKIFOROV is acting on behalf of or at the direction of a person who is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the energy sector.\n" ;
