  ammitto:status "active" ;
  ammitto:referenceNumber "RUS2743" ;
  ammitto:remarks "\nTHE MAIN DIRECTORATE OF DEEP-SEA RESEARCH OF THE MINISTRY OF DEFENCE OF THE RUSSIAN FEDERATION is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: THE MAIN DIRECTORATE OF DEEP-SEA RESEARCH OF THE MINISTRY OF DEFENCE OF THE RUSSIAN FEDERATION is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia through carrying on business as a Government of Russia-affiliated entity. \n" ;
