  ammitto:remarks "\nValery MAIOROV is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine by (1) engaging in, providing support for, or promoting any policy or action which destabilises Ukraine or undermines or threatens the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, namely the Government of Russia’s programme for the forced deportation and re-education of Ukrainian children; and (2) by working for, or being affiliated to, the Government of Russia in his role as Director of The Federal Center for the Development of Adolescent Socialization Programs. \n" ;
