  ammitto:remarks "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect AVERS BANK JOINT-STOCK COMPANY hereafter “AVERS BANK” is or has been obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia; namely, the Russian financial services sector.  \n" ;
